      icon rocket launch
    - label 2021
      desc Monthly cadence · Chrome 88–96 · 9 runs
      icon chart line
    - label 2022
      desc Chrome 97–108 · 13 runs · Windows run: Chrome 104
      icon desktop
    - label 2023
      desc Chrome 109–120 · 12 runs · Methodology shift at Chrome 118
